#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning.rst:5
#: 7b5726246a9a4e4eb3dee040bdd37a71
msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Tuning"
msgstr "传统直升机——调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning.rst:7
#: f30d519205594fb1925d1149b034f367
msgid ""
"This guide is broken out for manual and AutoTune tuning techniques.  Both "
"tuning techniques will require the user to perform the initial setup steps."
"  These initial setup steps are very important and have a significant impact"
" on the quality of the tune.  Both manual and AutoTune cover the tuning of "
"the feedforward gain, Rate PID gains, and angle P gain.  Additional tuning "
"topics cover adjusting the aircraft feel, further fine tuning of the I gain "
"as well as integrator management."
msgstr ""
"本指南分为手动调参和 AutoTune "
"调参技术两部分。两种调参技术都需要用户执行初始设置步骤。这些初始设置步骤非常重要，对调参质量有重大影响。手动调参和 AutoTune "
"都涵盖了前馈增益、速率 PID 增益和角度 P 增益的调参。其他调参主题涵盖了调整飞行手感、进一步微调 I 增益以及积分器管理。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tuning.rst:9
#: 861bc61ad46b45f7a374571bf6981c53
msgid ""
"For making setting changes to traditional helicopters, users are reminded to"
" use only the Full or Complete Parameter List, or the Heli SETUP page in "
"your ground station software. **Do not use the Basic, Extended or Advanced "
"Tuning pages that are designed for multi-rotor aircraft in Mission "
"Planner.** These pages will make unwanted setting changes to traditional "
"helicopters. And remember to write the changes to the autopilot after making"
" them or they won't be saved!"
msgstr ""
"为传统直升机进行设置更改时，提醒用户仅使用完整参数列表（Full 或 Complete Parameter List），或地面站软件中的 Heli "
"SETUP 页面。**请勿使用 Mission Planner 中为多旋翼飞机设计的 Basic、Extended 或 Advanced Tuning "
"页面。**这些页面会对传统直升机进行不必要的设置更改。另外，请记得在修改后将更改写入飞控，否则更改不会被保存！"

